WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.124
Freezing a pre-trained backbone and retraining only
the final layer is everywhere,

00:00:05.204 --> 00:00:07.408
and it defines a finite-rank kernel.

00:00:07.488 --> 00:00:11.660
Yet the theory lags: many results need the input
dimension to grow,

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:15.975
others fix how the ridge decays, and almost none
give a lower bound,

00:00:16.055 --> 00:00:18.640
without which tightness cannot be claimed.
